= Lenin Is Dead

Vladimir Lenin died on 21 January 1924, after a year of strokes had kept him out of politics. The succession is already being fought: Zinoviev, Kamenev and Stalin stand together against Trotsky. Whoever wins in Moscow will decide who leads in Berlin.
